%% CURRENT — the capture job states of the phone's CaptureJobStateMachine (committed code, Sep 2026).
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> RECORDING
  RECORDING --> TRANSCRIBING: stop
  TRANSCRIBING --> QUEUED: transcript saved
  TRANSCRIBING --> COMPLETED: no speech
  TRANSCRIBING --> FAILED_TRANSCRIPTION
  RECORDING --> FAILED_TRANSCRIPTION
  FAILED_TRANSCRIPTION --> TRANSCRIBING: retry from saved audio
  QUEUED --> PROCESSING: claim with a lease
  PROCESSING --> COMPLETED: result saved
  PROCESSING --> QUEUED: network retry scheduled
  PROCESSING --> FAILED_PROCESSING
  PROCESSING --> FAILED_RESEARCH
  FAILED_PROCESSING --> QUEUED: retry from saved transcript
  FAILED_RESEARCH --> QUEUED: retry from saved transcript
  FAILED_TRANSCRIPTION --> ABANDONED: retention limit
  COMPLETED --> [*]
